WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.339
Finally, we want to try something called positive plant activities.

00:00:04.339 --> 00:00:09.140
For many kids, these activities are fun and help with something called reward biases.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:13.740
The goal is to pick who you want to do something with, what you want to do, and when and where

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.019
it will happen.

00:00:15.019 --> 00:00:18.740
Sometimes, it's good to think about things to talk about during the activity.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:22.539
You can think of this activity like a wish list of what you hope will happen.

